{"id": "1549990779303235697", "channel_id": "1549508733040599070", "author_id": "1495990315960762388", "author_name": "morimensstaff86", "content": "We have identified that the Steam Deck currently does not fully support the display and signing functions required by our latest user agreement protocol. As resolving this compatibility issue involves complex verification and development time, we kindly ask for your understanding.\n\nTo ensure you can continue playing without interruption, please follow these steps:\n\nUse an Alternative Device: Log in to your game account on a different device, such as a PC or Mobile device.\nSign the Latest Agreement: Complete the signing process for the latest user agreement on that device.\nReturn to Steam Deck: Once the agreement is signed, you may switch back to your Steam Deck to resume gameplay.\nThis workaround will allow you to bypass the current limitation on the Steam Deck while we work on a permanent fix. We apologize for any inconvenience this may cause and appreciate your cooperation.", "timestamp": "2026-09-17T03:49:59.222000+00:00", "thread_id": "1549508733040599070", "thread_title": "Login Issues on Steam Deck", "forum_channel_id": "1180845276823564288", "thread_tags": ["1542488121562759179", "1542484376573583380"]}
{"id": "1549979733578747935", "channel_id": "1549128407164657725", "author_id": "1495990315960762388", "author_name": "morimensstaff86", "content": "Could you please clarify whether your reinstallation was an \"over-install\" (installing over existing files) or a clean installation (uninstalling first, then reinstalling)?\n\nTo resolve the issue, please try one of the following methods:\n\nReplace the Configuration File:\nContact a friend who plays Morimens and ask them to send you their _ab_info.json file, located in the Morimens\\_game_data_\\DownLoad\\ directory. Replace your local version of this file with theirs, and then attempt to log in to the game again.\n\nPerform a Clean Reinstallation:\nUninstall the game completely, ensuring no residual files remain. Specifically, verify that all files have been deleted from the following directories:\n\nC:\\Program Files (x86)\\Steam\\steamapps\\common\\Morimens\n[Your Steam Library Path]\\steamapps\\common\\Morimens (if installed on a different drive)\nOnce these directories are completely empty, proceed to reinstall the game.", "timestamp": "2026-09-17T03:06:05.716000+00:00", "thread_id": "1549128407164657725", "thread_title": "Black screen upon game start on Steam", "forum_channel_id": "1180845276823564288", "thread_tags": ["1542488121562759179", "1542484376573583380"]}
